      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I did get it working just now on my first attempt of the day. The problem / fix lies somewhere in these points:\n- I almost always play on VPN because an IPv6 issue keeps me from receiving requests\n- Yesterday I logged into VRChat using \"Login with Steam\" which I never do, I always \"Login with VRChat\"\n- Later that night I tried working on the map and could not get networked clients working\n- Shutdown computer for the night\n- This morning, tried again, clients both spun on \"Logging in with Steam\" and both failed to login\n- Logged in with VRChat on both local clients\n- One client got a disconnected error, had me log back in, now things work",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
